  "notes": "105:10-11 keeps the condition both tafsirs stress: «إذا اهتديتم» includes commanding good and forbidding evil. Light for «اهتديتم», geometric for «إلى الله مرجعكم». STAGING v4: 105: believers praying in a hall (attend to yourselves: reform your own souls). Nobody is shown straying or being left alone (the verse is not a licence to ignore others; both tafsirs include enjoining good). No gesture on the condition 105:10-11, only the light plate. They prostrate on 105:14 and sit on 105:16. Geometric on the Name (105:13). The return to Allah and the account are not drawn."
